+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on cache eviction policy. The project previously tracked a cache eviction decision in `config/decisions/revoke-cache-eviction.json`, but that file was removed from the repository (commit "move decision config out of the tree"), and no replacement decision has been recorded since. Until a new decision is recorded, no cache eviction policy should be assumed or implemented based on prior values.
